{"summary":"Why do I burn?","description":"Despite only being able to burn for 10 seconds, a little candle journeys into the darkness, with the purpose of seeking light.\n\nCandleman is a distinctive action adventure story entwined with low-light gameplay. Acting as a little candle who can burn for only 10 seconds, venture through an unsettling darkness with challenging levels and a smooth difficulty curve. Struggle to overcome obstacles based on the mechanics of light and shadow, explore a wide range of enchanted environments, and unveil hidden treasure as you seek the distant light.\n\nFeatures\n• Journey through dark, enchanting worlds with 10 seconds of light.\n• Face innovative challenges rooted in the mechanics of light and shadow.\n• Be immersed in a stunning fairytale that highlights everyday issues.","esrbNotes":"Fantasy Violence","pegiNotes":"Fear","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EwFYRdldHAM?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_aWSUAf8cDXhSQJ0CYZ4_g9JIMDLEyr9ciXW0L577EDHrnkHDS-7l_El-i1VCHJZN9l-DBxOqTkNcACTw-I8D_c","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WWew1XKSkQGjVjJ31bKT15MA1eURpB6I60VoQRPYgjZrbS5JaOajZs6EalLlY0V37e9n_GfWmkS9yuwUpJU7cQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Dn7SNStCO8SsvWKjbrdF7Ux6O9l5GzSxK9a-QkkU9Ou6yMsuhTYwshkvQFjCIOps37ZrUVlKB_Kjkv68Tjm5","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JWlXPNABFQmE0AJlJUsinoSKF5rRngDo6fZTjnlxvUeFNdEJxRAaWq6aaEJ_5r3v5peEGD0jMM8Gxy9yCBisHQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RuCRHe8anSHNgj0iP036N3sHTqU-gOgzxBZHs1jOsAVbXgLS-czopF8qWKc887GDrxqMp-za2nv6uAYFAuQ2","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jikIS2XlqWXUoP-UPKU82baoFy9ts5H-r4brIUHisI1jV5OCRQ8s0EolKeMh_8BwbGL-jJh_vDcO1n1qj3fQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SbZ1NISxb_LyUI3YAvJB6MllCFBiLXxQTOWK8Abi3UocP6J61hqzwFw9sJOpYrBL-R-hyRSTk3AJwTN-vdlWILs","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WWew1XKSkQGjVjJ31bKT15MA1eURpB6I60VoQRPYgjZrbS5JaOajZs6EalLlY0V37e9n_GfWmkS